    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Instead of applying explicit formatting to text, you can enclose a span of a text in a non-formatting element. This type of markup is referred to as a text span (formerly known as "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "unquoted text"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). It’s purpose is to allow attributes such as role and ID to be applied to unformatted text. Though those attributes can still be used to apply styles to the text."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When text is enclosed in a pair of single or double hash symbols ("
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "#"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "and"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " has at least one role, the role(s) will be applied to that text without adding any other implicit formatting."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "admonition",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If no attrlist is present, the formatting pair will be interpreted as "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "highlighted text"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "highlight.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " instead."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "caution"
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-text-span",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The text [.underline]#underline me# is underlined."
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Text span syntax"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Example 1"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#ex-text-span"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is converted to HTML, it translates into the following output."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The text <span class=\"underline\">underline me</span> is underlined."
              }
            ],
            "language": "html",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Text span HTML output"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "As you can see, it’s up to the stylesheet to provide styles for this element. Typically, this means you’ll need to "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "define custom inline styles"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "custom-inline-styles.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " that map to the corresponding class. In this case, since "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "underline"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is a built-in role, the style is provided for you."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_text_span_syntax",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Text span syntax"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The AsciiDoc language provides a handful of built-in roles you can use to provide formatting hints for the text. While these roles are often used with a text span, they can also be used with any other formatted text for which a role is accepted."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "admonition",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Not all converters recognize these roles, though you can expect them to at least be supported by the HTML converter."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "warning"
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "These roles are as follows:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "dlist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Applies an underline decoration to the span of text."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "underline"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Applies an overline decoration to the span of text."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "overline"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Applies a line-through (aka strikethrough) decoration to the span of text."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "line-through"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Disables words within the span of text from being broken."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "nobreak"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Prevents the span of text from wrapping at all."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "nowrap"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Prevents sequences of space and space-like characters from being collapsed (i.e., all spaces are preserved)."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "pre-wrap"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "There are several built-in roles that were once supported in AsciiDoc, but have since been deprecated. These roles include "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "big"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "small"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", named colors (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "aqua"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "), and named background colors (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "aqua-background"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). You should create your own semantic roles in place of these deprecated roles."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "built-in",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Built-in roles for text"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "outline": null,
    "title": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "Text Span and Built-in Roles"
      }
    ]
  }
}
